        "Text": {
          "type": "cexolocstring",
          "value": {
            "0": "Coin talks plainer than sentiment, friend. When you buy a barrel you buy all of it -- top froth to last drop, that's simple arithmetic. Marigold's a dear soul, but grief isn't a bill of sale. And Ned Puddifoot wants paying for his barrow work in ale, which I call double-dipping."
